SUMMARY:Pole Dance & Burlesque
DESCRIPTION:Th0tty McNaughty is thrilled to bring to Sebastopol a monthly revue featuring a wide variety of performers. The September show features Manila Sunrise\, Shiree Amour\, Lucky Lex\, Cha Cha Hoops\, Carrenne\, Krystle\, Kim\, and Twerk-A-Rella!\n\nDoors open at 7:00 PM Show starts at 7:30 PM at the Main Street Theater in Sebastopol\, an intimate up close experience. Tickets start at $25 for general admission\, $30 for 2nd row seating and $35 for the up close and immersive experience of the front row. \nMAIN STREET THEATER 104 N. MAIN ST. SEBASTOPOL
