SUMMARY:Honoring the Sacred Feminine
DESCRIPTION:A Day of Reflection and Exploration For Men and Women\nConducted by Ginny Matthews & Regina Sara Ryan \nThe Sacred Feminine is an energetic life force that is present (at least in seed-form) in all of us\, whatever our gender. Disconnected from this aspect of our essential nature\, we lose touch with the full promise and possibility of Life. This gathering is designed to encourage us all (men & women) to recognize and renew our dedication to this Sacred Feminine power of creation: the power that supports life in all forms\, nurtures health and happiness in ourselves and others\, and forgives\, blesses and eases pain and suffering wherever it is found. The responsibility\, privilege and joy of honoring and renewing this Sacred Feminine Principle in our world today is a necessity…and now more than ever. \nGinny and Regina will lead us in a few meaningful rituals\, and encourage us to create our own that we can integrate into daily life. They will offer some guidance in meditation practice\, and allow time to “write from the heart\,” as a way to keep our connection to heart alive. Music\, movement and chant will allow us to celebrate what we know\, what we are\, and make an offering to others.\nYou can use this day to rest and inspire yourself in the company of other pilgrims on a sacred path. A chance to put away cellphones\, computers\, family and business work\, to deepen your connection with nature\, and to focus on what feeds your soul.\nIf interested in participating\, please contact Ginny Matthews at myosho@sonic.net so we may prepare the space and expect you.
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/honoring-the-sacred-feminine/
LOCATION:Tayu House\, Sebastopol
ORGANIZER;CN="Tayu Order":MAILTO:myosho@sonic.net
END:VEVENT
