SUMMARY:Hardly Strictly Irish Harvest Moon Concert & Potluck/Ceili After-Party
DESCRIPTION:Hardly Strictly Irish Harvest Moon Concert & Potluck/Ceili After-Party \nSeptember 26\, 2026\nConcert 5:00-6:30 p.m./Doors 4:30 p.m.\nPotluck/Ceili After-Party 6:30-7:30 p.m. \nHARDLY STRICTLY IRISH (Suzuki Cady and Jimmy Murphy) – An uplifting mix of traditional Irish tunes and Roots/Americana/Bluegrass songs on fiddle\, mandolin\, guitar\, banjo\, and bodhrán. \nShiloh Step Irish Dance of Santa Rosa will give a demo at intermission and can teach a few steps during the Potluck After-Party. Bring a potluck dish (optional) to share after the show. Celebrate the bounty of the full Harvest Moon in community! \nSt. Stephen’s sanctuary has great acoustics\, comfortable seats\, room to dance\, and plenty of parking! \n500 Robinson Road\, Sebastopol CA \nTICKETS: GENERAL $25/$20 Seniors & Youth | DOOR (if not sold out) $35/$30 (doors at 4:30 p.m.)\nhttps://tixfox.co/e/harvestmoon \nMore information: https://suzukicady.com
